 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Itch.io Itching For Games Bundle 2 Submissions</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/ultimate-300-bundle-submissions/rate/2011950\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Ultimate 300 Bundle Submissions</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/itching-for-games-3/rate/2011950\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Itching for Games 3</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/2011950/crash-course\" data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Crash Course\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMjc0Nzk3LnBuZw==/original/9Kz6X2.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Crash Course</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" id=\"view_game_6571831\" itemscope class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://orbit-games-inc.itch.io/crash-course/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$6.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Get ready to unleash chaos in Crash Course, the physics-based puzzle game that will challenge your strategic skills! With over 100 levels to master, you&#x27;ll need to use explosive and magical blocks to create epic chain reactions of destruction. Knock down all the golden blocks in each level to progress through the game, but watch out for the skulls and other obstacles that stand in your way.<br></p>\r\n<p>Available on Windows, Mac, Linux, and Android,&nbsp;Crash Course is the ultimate physics-based puzzle game for anyone who loves strategic gameplay, chain reactions, and dynamic destruction. So what are you waiting for? Get&nbsp;Crash Course today and start creating epic chaos!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMjkyMDM0LmdpZg==/original/SSrih9.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h3>Meet the Blocks</h3>\r\n<p>Crash Course&nbsp;features a variety of different block types that add to the puzzle-solving experience. Here are just a few of them:\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMDczMjE1LnBuZw==/original/zlA96e.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Explosion blocks&nbsp;- </strong>Want to create chaos? Look no further than the explosive block! These blocks act like bombs, sending surrounding blocks flying in all directions. And if you&#x27;re lucky enough to ignite other explosion blocks, watch out for the fireworks!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMjc0ODQ1LnBuZw==/original/nOLlWH.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Implosion blocks</strong>&nbsp;- Sometimes, you need to pull things together rather than push them apart. That&#x27;s where implosion blocks come in - use them to pull other blocks closer together, creating the perfect setup for some explosive magic!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMDczMjgzLnBuZw==/original/U0synM.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Magic blocks</strong>&nbsp;- What&#x27;s better than knocking blocks down? Turning them into something else entirely! Magic blocks are the key to transformation - just colliding two of them together creates a puff of smoke, transforming any nearby wooden blocks into magic blocks. Get ready for some serious magic and mayhem!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMjc0ODQ2LnBuZw==/original/eU5s9u.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<strong>Ignite blocks -&nbsp;</strong>are ticking time bombs that can create a spectacular chain reaction when they touch each other. Your objective is to strategically use the ball to knock them into each other and ignite the explosive blocks for maximum destruction. But be careful, a single wrong move can cause the blocks to not touch and you might miss your chance for an explosive chain reaction!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMDczMzE2LnBuZw==/original/528n%2BD.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Pop blocks</strong> - Bounce your way to victory with the bouncy and poppy pop blocks! Use your ball to hit these blocks and watch them disappear, destabilizing the structure and causing it to come crashing down. With some strategic aim, you can hit multiple pop blocks in one shot, creating a chain reaction of bouncing and popping!</p>\r\n<h3>Features</h3>\r\n<ul><li>Over 100 levels of physics-based puzzle fun\r\n</li><li>Gamepad support\r\n</li><li>Available on Windows, Mac, Linux, and Android\r\n</li><li>Multiple game modes with unique challenges\r\n</li><li>Realistic physics system for dynamic destruction\r\n</li><li>Colorful graphics and visual effects\r\n</li><li>Easy to learn, difficult to master gameplay</li></ul>\r\n<p>Are you a games journalist or blogger? Check out the <a href=\"https://orbit-games.net/#presskit=crashcourse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Presskit</a></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_4982681\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"23 September 2026 @ 16:37 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td>